dades de saúde e laboratórios.</p>		\n			<a href=\"#\" role=\"button\">\n						MAIS\n					</a>\n			<h5>Desporto:</h5>		\n		<p>Equipamentos desportivos para clubes e unidades desportivas, municipios. </p>		\n			<a href=\"#\" role=\"button\">\n						MAIS\n					</a>\n			<h5>Ambiente:</h5>		\n		<p>Sistemas de monitorização da água, solo e ar, unidades de tratamento de águas e águas residuais, instrumentação e sistemas de aquisição e registo de dados para empresas de distribuição de água, empresas de saneamento, institutos de monitorização do ambiente.</p>		\n			<a href=\"#\" role=\"button\">\n						MORE\n					</a>\n			<h2>DEPOIMENTOS</h2>		\n		<p>Click edit button to change this text. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut elit tellus.</p>		\n			<a href=\"#\" role=\"button\">\n						VIEW ALL\n					</a>\n		<p>Click edit button to change this text excellent plumbing services sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut elit tellus, luctus nec ullamcorper mattis. Proin gravida nibh vel velit auctor aliquet.</p>		\n			<h6>Donald Hunter</h6>		\n		<p>Neque porro quisquam est, qui dolorem ipsum quia showed up within 2 hours dolor sit amet aptent taciti sociosqu ad litora egestas quam...</p>		\n			<h6>Rachel Hughes</h6>		\n			<h1>Nossos parceiros:</h1>		\n				<figure><a href=\"#\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"e6fed57\" data-elementor-lightbox-index=\"0\"><img src=\"https://trionica.cloudaccess.host/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/cp-40.png\" alt=\"cp-40\" /></a></figure><figure><a href=\"#\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"e6fed57\" data-elementor-lightbox-index=\"1\"><img src=\"https://trionica.cloudaccess.host/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/download.png\" alt=\"download\" /></a></figure><figure><a href=\"#\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"e6fed57\" data-elementor-lightbox-index=\"2\"><img src=\"https://trionica.cloudaccess.host/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/imageedit_7_6827227186.png\" alt=\"imageedit_7_6827227186\" /></a></figure><figure><a href=\"#\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"e6fed57\" data-elementor-lightbox-index=\"3\"><img src=\"https://trionica.cloudaccess.host/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/lab-supply-logo-ideas-450x-184px.png\" alt=\"lab-supply-logo-ideas-450x-184px\" /></a></figure><figure><a href=\"#\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"e6fed57\" data-elementor-lightbox-index=\"4\"><img src=\"https://trionica.cloudaccess.host/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/LasecLogo.png\" alt=\"LasecLogo\" /></a></figure><figure><a href=\"#\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"e6fed57\" data-elementor-lightbox-index=\"5\"><img src=\"https://trionica.cloudaccess.host/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/logo.png\" alt=\"logo\" /></a></figure><figure><a href=\"#\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"e6fed57\" data-elementor-lightbox-index=\"6\"><img src=\"https://trionica.cloudaccess.host/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/logo_DIS-1024x252.png\" alt=\"logo_DIS\" /></a></figure><figure><a href=\"#\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"e6fed57\" data-elementor-lightbox-index=\"7\"><img src=\"https://trionica.cloudaccess.host/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/Logo_Matest_def-01-e1508228789861-1024x232.jpg\" alt=\"Logo_Matest_def-01-e1508228789861\" /></a></figure><figure><a href=\"#\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"e6fed57\" data-elementor-lightbox-index=\"8\"><img src=\"https://trionica.cloudaccess.host/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/logo_optika_italy_black.png\" alt=\"logo_optika_italy_black\" /></a></figure><figure><a href=\"#\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"e6fed57\" data-elementor-lightbox-index=\"9\"><img src=\"https://trionica.cloudaccess.host/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/lucas_nuelle_en-us.svg\" alt=