								EQUIPAMENTOS GEOFÍSICA \n									</li>\n								<li >\n										MOBILIÁRIO ESCOLAR\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n			<h2>Links Rápidos</h2>		\n					<ul>\n							<li >\n										CLIMA\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										ÁGUA\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										ENERGIA​\n									</li>\n								<li >\n										EQUIPAMENTO DE CAMPO​\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n		<p>Copyright © 2019 Trionica | Designed by Kiyanda Tec</p>		\n							<a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n					Facebook\n				</a>\n							<a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n					Twitter\n				</a>\n							<a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n					Google-plus\n				</a>', 'HOME', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1043-revision-v1', '', '', '2019-03-14 08:58:29', '2019-03-14 08:58:29', '', '1043', 'https://trionica.cloudaccess.host/2019/03/14/1043-revision-v1/', '0', 'revision', '', '0');
